/// green root: the package plus func names, the TempDir,
/// candidate, recover, ReadDir, len, Fatal, Fatalf
/// spellings, the inspected/break/HasPrefix/IsDir guard
/// spellings, the cache prefix, marker, lease, schema
/// names, the recovery bound, the single leftover, and
/// the bound-guard verdict.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): bound-guarded
/// pins bool from the inspected guard (impl L149);
/// overflow-left pins int 1 from the len guard (L169);
/// limit pins int 16 (L30); op spellings pin the exact Go
/// identifiers (TempDir L153, candidate L155,
