/// tempdir-op pins TempDir (L153); candidate-op pins
/// candidate (L155); recover-op pins recoverAbandoned
/// (L157); readdir-op pins ReadDir (L165); len-op pins len
/// (L158); fatal-op pins t.Fatal (L163/L167); fatalf-op
/// pins t.Fatalf (L159/L170); inspected-var pins inspected
/// (impl L144); break-op pins break (impl L150);
/// prefix-op pins HasPrefix (impl L146); isdir-op pins
