/// can-suite-cache- (impl L21); marker-name pins
/// .can-test-owner.json (impl L22); lease-name pins
/// .can-test-lease (impl L23); schema-name pins
/// can.test-suite-cache/1 (impl L24); recovery-limit pins
/// 16 (impl L30); overflow-left pins 1 (L169);
/// bound-guarded pins true (impl L149).
/// Answer verdicts live in history-038-cache-semantics.can;
